<p>MUSLIM ASWS. KE SAR KO ZALIM DAR DAR PHIRAA RAHE HAIN.</p>

<p>MARQAD MEIN SAYYADA S.A. KO YUN BHI RULAA RAHE HAIN.</p>

<p>1. ALLAH RE MUSLIM ASWS. KA KOI NAHI THA MOHSIN.</p>

<p>ZILHIJJA KI NAWI THI AUR ARFE KA THA WO DIN.</p>

<p>GHURBAT MEIN BEQATA KO AADA L.A. SATAA RAHE HAIN.</p>

<p>2. EID E ZOHA KA TUJHKO KUCH TO LIHAAZ HOTA.</p>

<p>HAAYE AHLEBAIT PAR TU AISE ZULAM NA DHAATA.</p>

<p>YASRAB MEIN MUSTAFA SAWW. BHI AANSOO BAHAA RAHE HAIN.</p>

<p>3. MUSLIM ASWS. KE LAAL DONO DAR DAR BHATAK RAHE HAIN.</p>

<p>ROTE HUE WO BEKAS BABA KO TAK RAHE HAIN.</p>

<p>SEHME HUE HAI BACHE MAA KO BULAA RAHE HAIN..</p>

<p>4. QANJAR KO YUN CHAMKAAYE AAYA QAREEB E MUSLIM ASWS.</p>

<p>KEHNE LAGE TADAP KE US DAM YEH HAAYE MUSLIM.</p>

<p>BEJURM BEQATA KO AADA L.A. RULAA RAHE HAIN.</p>

<p><center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB SYED MOHEBBE ABID ABIDI SAHAB QIBLA.</h4></center></p>
